## Recommended order of repair

1. Resolve the TypeScript toolchain conflict first. Pick versions supported
   together by Astro, `astro check`, and `typescript-eslint`; otherwise verify
   the TypeScript `7.1+` `@astrojs/ts-content-mapper` path.
2. Move pagination constants inside `getStaticPaths()`.
3. Align Node, pnpm, Tailwind, and TypeScript versions in `package.json` and
   lockfile; add explicit version policy if "no version drift" is required.
4. Fix deprecated Zod URL calls.
5. Populate or correct empty content collection paths.
6. Re-run `check`, `build`, `typecheck`, `lint`, and `test`.
